* Mon Nov 16 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.5
- New: push notifications through UnifiedPush (Foghorn): nothing of
  Rustrx keeps running while it is closed; one choice in Settings for
  when Rustrx is closed (push, background, none).
- New: favourites with new messages glow in the lists (Appearance).
- New: each tab keeps its own order and filter switches; room settings
  list threads and members (searchable) on pages of their own; the
  emoji button in threads.
- Fixed: idle CPU about 30 times lower (an SDK store lock renewed 20
  times a second; room updates redid work for every room).
- Fixed: the chat keeps its place after a picture, a thread or settings;
  rooms are marked read once the newest message is in view.
- Fixed: membership changes named in the room list; reply quotes in
  threads load; the invitations header no longer overlaps a row.

* Sun Nov 15 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.4
- New: calls through Element Call (unencrypted rooms; encrypted ones
  need a newer browser engine); incoming calls ring with Answer and
  Decline; a running call shows in the room and the room list.
- New: threads: replies marked in the room, a thread's page, Reply in
  thread, the room's threads in its settings, new replies marked.
- New: spaces: a Spaces tab, a space's rooms and subspaces, making
  spaces and rooms in them, adding and removing rooms, leaving.
- New: who can join a room or space; requests to join (knocking) with a
  notification and a list to answer; asking to join; a preview before
  joining by address or link.
- New: emoji as Twemoji pictures; an emoji picker in the keyboard's
  place behind a smiley button; custom emoji and stickers from image
  packs; "Add to my emoji"; text reactions.
- New: the push-up menu sends on its own or attaches to a drafted
  message; a chat cover; a first start notice about the prototype and
  its debug log.
- Fixed: message HTML as the spec has it (spoilers hidden, no outside
  pictures loaded); reply quotes always show; sharing offers every chat;
  back from a picture the chat stays where it was; invitation banners
  answered elsewhere go.

* Sun Nov 15 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.3
- Fixed: the keyboard stays up after Send and when a message comes in.
- Fixed: a room opens at the newest message, not where another client
  left the read marker.
- Fixed: previews of WebP pictures and of videos; a video that can not
  be played says why.
- New: the local store is encrypted with a key kept in sailfish-secrets
  where it works, as before elsewhere.
- New: a session ended by the server keeps the store and the device, so
  logging in again brings back keys and history.
- New: a debug log, on until 1.0, shareable from Settings.
- New: portrait and landscape; one's own picture in Settings; "Hide
  muted" in the filter menu; switches for the background line and the
  "Typing to <room>" line under the message field.

* Sat Nov 14 2026 moWerk <mo@mowerk.net> - 0.4.2
- Fixed: single sign-on opens the browser again (broken since 0.4.0); the
  sign-on link is shown to open again or copy; sign-on is offered as soon
  as a full Matrix ID is typed.
- Fixed: a token refresh that fails for lack of network no longer logs
  out (servers with short-lived tokens, such as tchncs.de).
- New: a notification for each new invitation.
- New: the "not verified" line opens the encryption settings; "Reset
  encryption" for an account with no other device and no recovery key.
- New: a hint on servers that manage logins in the browser; more space
  between buttons and texts on the login and settings pages; an empty
  tab says so instead of spinning.
- Polish: smaller avatars, Semibold badge digits with a shadow, a larger
  filter icon, "Alphabetical", lists start at the top, a larger cover icon.
- New: "Favourites on top" and "Low priority at the bottom" in the filter
  menu, with any order; "Unread first" sorts by count.
- New: room pictures (set, shown on the room page and in the chat header;
  changes by others update); View source for a message; "@" prefilled in
  Matrix ID fields; Settings reordered with devices in place and an About
  section with the LLMGD grade.
- Fixed: copy and save feedback, a visible cancel for replies and edits,
  error messages in words, remorse when declining an invitation.
- New: room search in the filter menu; mute, lock and read status before
  the preview; 1 to 3 preview lines; one list instead of tabs, optional;
  double tap to reply; upgraded rooms lead to their successor.

